WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:07.760
SCP-096 Vs SCP-1361. SCP-096&nbsp;
may be an unstoppable force,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.760 --> 00:00:14.160
but will SCP-1361, the all-devouring mass of&nbsp;
animal meat slurry, be an immovable object?

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:19.040
We all know SCP-096 is tough: It&nbsp;
shrugs off the biggest guns we have,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.040 --> 00:00:23.440
can move at lightning speed, and can track&nbsp;
down targets like a heat-seeking missile.

00:00:23.440 --> 00:00:28.880
SCP-1361 is a giant roving blob of meat&nbsp;
that absorbs and digests its victims,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:28.880 --> 00:00:30.960
adding to its ever-growing mass.

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:37.440
But we personally think 096 would bring this one&nbsp;
home. 1361 has the advantage of not having eyes,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:37.440 --> 00:00:44.880
and thus, could not activate 096’s rage state.&nbsp;
But, even if 1361 could digest 096’s flesh,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:44.880 --> 00:00:48.480
we’d bet money that it couldn’t put&nbsp;
a scratch on the monster’s skeleton.

00:00:48.480 --> 00:00:53.360
It would crawl out of the blob and reform,&nbsp;
ready to maim and maul another day.

